{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Human-AI Collaboration.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Human-AI Collaboration.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"human ai collaboration human ai collaboration","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Human-AI Collaboration.md","fileName":"Human-AI Collaboration.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Human-AI Collaboration","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-05 23:09\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[AI Labor and Environmental Ethics]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["AI Labor and Environmental Ethics","aiethics.epub"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Human-AI Collaboration.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Human-AI Collaboration.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"human ai collaboration human ai collaboration","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Human-AI Collaboration.md","fileName":"Human-AI Collaboration.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Human-AI Collaboration","heading":"Human-AI Collaboration","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"Human-AI collaboration divides activity between machine pattern recognition and human judgment, experience, or responsibility. It can use automation to extend human capability without assuming that either partner should perform the whole task.\n\nThe arrangement is ethical only when the human role is substantive. A person who must approve opaque outputs at machine speed may provide the appearance of oversight without real control. Good collaboration preserves the knowledge, time, authority, and feedback needed to question the system. It also recognizes that practical wisdom and contextual understanding cannot simply be delegated to statistical prediction.","tags":["baby"],"links":["AI Labor and Environmental Ethics","aiethics.epub"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"